<title>USA: U.S. Alcohol names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>U.S. Alcohol names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CUCAMONGA, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Alcohol Testing of America Inc said Thursday it has appointed Dennis Wittman as chief financial officer of the company and its units, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Wittman spent the past four years as a vice president and principal financial officer for Harvey Universal Inc which went public in 1993.</p>
<p>Wittman replaces Gary Wolff, who resigned in early July to pursue other interests.</p>
